    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What started as a night shift at the movie theater\u2014just as a favor for a friend\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >quickly turns into something strange.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bizarre phenomenon pulls you into the video itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside, the truth slowly begins to unravel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must embark on a journey to uncover it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part-time job simulation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various cinematic effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror-themed effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two different endings.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2Ending</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the hidden clues and uncover the true ending.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What started as a night shift at the movie theater\u2014just as a favor for a friend\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >quickly turns into something strange.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bizarre phenomenon pulls you into the video itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside, the truth slowly begins to unravel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must embark on a journey to uncover it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part-time job simulation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various cinematic effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a variety of locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror-themed effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two different endings.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2Ending</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the hidden clues and uncover the true ending.</p>",
    "short_description": "The story unfolds through the eyes of a first-person protagonist. While working part-time at an old movie theater, the protagonist begins to experience strange and unexplainable events. You must survive the presence that lurks within the theater and uncover hidden clues to reach a meaningful ending.",
